      "writtenOn": "2020-09-09T23:00:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of requiring all callers now call this,can we instead keep initiateSilentRedial for non emergency and then create a new method called \u0027initiateSilentRedialForEmergency(int eccCategory)\u0027?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1528,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 1528,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "86cf4d212afdf0be9c33143b4fe42225155729ad",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
